<title>USA: Manor Care takes 51 pct stake in Vitalink.</title>
<headline>Manor Care takes 51 pct stake in Vitalink.</headline>
<dateline>GAITHERSBURG, Md. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manor Care said it accepted 1.5 million shares of Vitalink common stock in connection with its tender offer, and now owns about 51 percent of Vitalink's outstanding shares.</p>
<p>The company said th 1.5 million shares represents about 31.1 percent of the shares of Vitalink.</p>
<p>Manor Care said payment for the accepted shares will be made on June 2.</p>
</text>
